  "summary": "The saved mask comes from /tmp/mask.npy written by C11 (C7, C8 and C10 failed before saving), and C21 reshapes it and writes it. In C11, all 92 target days of every sea cell are compared with the smoothed threshold. The cumulative-sum smoothing makes each target-band threshold an arithmetic function of the raw thresholds for days of year 1-259 and 352-366, with day 60 filled from days 59 and 61. Those raw thresholds draw on the \u00b15-row pools, so baseline values from 1 Jan to 20 Sep and from 12 Dec to 31 Dec of each year reach the mask; the 1991-12-27..31 and 2003-01-01..05 extension days also contribute."
